<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?><transcript><text start="0.1" dur="1.71">Fable 5 is the</text><text start="0.832" dur="1.467">world&amp;#39;s</text><text start="1.321" dur="1.466">most</text><text start="1.809" dur="1.822">powerful AI</text><text start="2.653" dur="1.866">model, and the</text><text start="3.541" dur="1.844"></text><text start="4.407" dur="1.466">most</text><text start="4.896" dur="1.799">important</text><text start="5.717" dur="1.689">thing you&amp;#39;ve built this year is</text><text start="6.428" dur="1.821">an agentic</text><text start="7.271" dur="1.533">operating</text><text start="7.827" dur="1.844">system.  And in</text><text start="8.695" dur="1.916">this video, I&amp;#39;ll</text><text start="9.635" dur="1.87"></text><text start="10.528" dur="1.776"></text><text start="11.327" dur="1.776"></text><text start="12.127" dur="1.517">show you the new capabilities of Fable 5,</text><text start="12.667" dur="1.8"></text><text start="13.49" dur="1.611">divided into five tiers, that will</text><text start="14.125" dur="1.658"></text><text start="14.806" dur="1.847"></text><text start="15.676" dur="1.588"></text><text start="16.287" dur="1.659"></text><text start="16.969" dur="1.893"></text><text start="17.886" dur="1.729"></text><text start="18.638" dur="1.799">help you get more done, build faster than ever, and even save money</text><text start="19.461" dur="1.893">so you do</text><text start="20.378" dur="1.893">n&amp;#39;t fall behind.</text><text start="21.271" dur="1.716">And if you&amp;#39;re</text><text start="22.006" dur="1.733">new,</text><text start="22.758" dur="1.47">I&amp;#39;m Jack</text><text start="23.246" dur="1.677">Roberts.  I</text><text start="23.937" dur="1.306"></text><text start="24.257" dur="1.377"></text><text start="24.648" dur="1.459"></text><text start="25.121" dur="1.307">built and</text><text start="25.442" dur="1.487">sold my last tech startup,</text><text start="25.943" dur="1.391">which</text><text start="26.348" dur="1.432">had countless customers.</text><text start="26.88" dur="1.576">Now I&amp;#39;m building my</text><text start="27.474" dur="1.45">own AI</text><text start="27.942" dur="1.486">startup.</text><text start="28.446" dur="1.764">And</text><text start="29.228" dur="1.624">here I</text><text start="29.869" dur="1.428"></text><text start="30.315" dur="1.57">share the things that</text><text start="30.903" dur="1.678">really work.</text><text start="31.681" dur="1.57">So, if you haven&amp;#39;t already</text><text start="32.268" dur="1.571">,</text><text start="32.856" dur="1.449"></text><text start="33.322" dur="1.657">grab a nice cup of coffee</text><text start="33.997" dur="1.656">and let&amp;#39;s get straight to the point.</text><text start="34.671" dur="1.363"></text><text start="35.051" dur="1.657"></text><text start="35.708" dur="1.819">So, this</text><text start="36.547" dur="1.709">is the agentic</text><text start="37.277" dur="1.5">operating</text><text start="37.798" dur="1.794">system.  And in</text><text start="38.613" dur="1.837">this video, I&amp;#39;ll</text><text start="39.471" dur="1.794"></text><text start="40.287" dur="1.6"></text><text start="40.909" dur="1.515"></text><text start="41.445" dur="1.794"></text><text start="42.261" dur="1.665"></text><text start="42.947" dur="1.885">show you those five layers of the Fable 5 Agentic Operating System.  But first of all</text><text start="43.854" dur="1.51">,</text><text start="44.386" dur="1.642">of course, when</text><text start="45.05" dur="1.775">we&amp;#39;re</text><text start="45.848" dur="1.797">talking about Fable 5,</text><text start="46.667" dur="1.842">we&amp;#39;re talking about a new</text><text start="47.531" dur="1.753">type of model.</text><text start="48.306" dur="1.838">This is the</text><text start="49.165" dur="1.636"></text><text start="49.821" dur="1.719">best and</text><text start="50.56" dur="1.37">most</text><text start="50.95" dur="1.554">powerful</text><text start="51.525" dur="1.518">model we have.  This</text><text start="52.062" dur="1.406">graph has</text><text start="52.486" dur="1.572">a lot of lines</text><text start="53.076" dur="1.498"></text><text start="53.593" dur="1.701">going in a certain direction, and</text><text start="54.312" dur="1.517"></text><text start="54.847" dur="1.701"></text><text start="55.567" dur="1.609"></text><text start="56.194" dur="1.701">we all know that lines going up means something good.</text><text start="56.895" dur="1.728">People are saying, &amp;quot;</text><text start="57.623" dur="1.721">Jack, I just</text><text start="58.362" dur="1.702"></text><text start="59.082" dur="1.684">say the name Fable 5 and</text><text start="59.784" dur="1.628">my credit</text><text start="60.431" dur="1.61">runs out.&amp;quot;</text><text start="61.141" dur="1.619">I will help you with that too in this video.</text><text start="61.776" dur="1.407"></text><text start="62.199" dur="1.44"></text><text start="62.656" dur="1.554"></text><text start="63.31" dur="1.729">This is really very</text><text start="64.059" dur="1.749">important.</text><text start="64.908" dur="1.736">But the bottom line is that</text><text start="65.662" dur="1.416">Fable 5 is</text><text start="66.096" dur="1.567">incredibly</text><text start="66.681" dur="1.284"></text><text start="66.983" dur="1.699">powerful and</text><text start="67.701" dur="1.415">we will use it to</text><text start="68.135" dur="1.585"></text><text start="68.738" dur="1.34"></text><text start="69.097" dur="1.453"></text><text start="69.569" dur="1.453"></text><text start="70.041" dur="1.509"></text><text start="70.569" dur="1.566">greatly</text><text start="71.154" dur="1.841">improve our agentic operating system.  Now, there</text><text start="72.016" dur="1.807"></text><text start="72.845" dur="1.509"></text><text start="73.376" dur="1.51"></text><text start="73.907" dur="1.446"></text><text start="74.374" dur="1.659"></text><text start="75.054" dur="1.531"></text><text start="75.606" dur="1.759">are many reasons why you need an agentic operating system.  Um,</text><text start="76.384" dur="1.75">three of the big</text><text start="77.154" dur="1.434">reasons for this are</text><text start="77.607" dur="1.474">unified</text><text start="78.101" dur="1.434"></text><text start="78.554" dur="1.415"></text><text start="78.988" dur="1.645">memory.  And</text><text start="79.647" dur="1.507">when I</text><text start="80.169" dur="1.506">show you these,</text><text start="80.69" dur="1.405">you&amp;#39;ll understand</text><text start="81.11" dur="1.449">so that</text><text start="81.573" dur="1.55">together we can create these</text><text start="82.138" dur="1.26">five</text><text start="82.413" dur="1.434">incredible</text><text start="82.862" dur="1.55">layers.</text><text start="83.426" dur="1.803"></text><text start="84.251" dur="1.772">Having a memory that is</text><text start="85.045" dur="1.75"></text><text start="85.817" dur="1.53">connected to everything.</text><text start="86.447" dur="1.807">So whether you&amp;#39;re</text><text start="87.28" dur="1.911">working on the phone</text><text start="88.217" dur="1.573">or</text><text start="88.816" dur="1.547"></text><text start="89.389" dur="1.651"></text><text start="90.066" dur="1.547"></text><text start="90.639" dur="1.99">using Hermes Agent or OpenCL,</text><text start="91.655" dur="1.729">it</text><text start="92.41" dur="1.729"></text><text start="93.165" dur="1.573"></text><text start="93.764" dur="1.807"></text><text start="94.597" dur="2.016">gives you the opportunity to bring your whole world into one place,</text><text start="95.639" dur="1.833">which means</text><text start="96.499" dur="1.885">Hermes knows</text><text start="97.41" dur="1.885"></text><text start="98.321" dur="1.756">what&amp;#39;s happening with Claude and</text><text start="99.103" dur="1.729">Claude knows</text><text start="99.858" dur="1.703"></text><text start="100.587" dur="1.912">what&amp;#39;s happening with Hermes.    Even if</text><text start="101.599" dur="1.781">you&amp;#39;re on a different</text><text start="102.401" dur="1.494">laptop</text><text start="102.915" dur="1.391">,</text><text start="103.327" dur="1.761">wherever you are</text><text start="104.109" dur="1.494">, whatever&amp;#39;s</text><text start="104.623" dur="1.72">happening</text><text start="105.364" dur="1.535">,</text><text start="105.919" dur="1.638">everything you have is connected to a</text><text start="106.578" dur="1.617">seamless</text><text start="107.216" dur="1.555">system.  That&amp;#39;s</text><text start="107.792" dur="1.699"></text><text start="108.512" dur="1.86">why</text><text start="109.393" dur="1.452">it&amp;#39;s so</text><text start="109.865" dur="1.802">important.</text><text start="110.767" dur="1.467">Another thing</text><text start="111.249" dur="1.498">is, we</text><text start="111.762" dur="1.438"></text><text start="112.215" dur="1.468"></text><text start="112.698" dur="1.574">can now do something with Fable 5</text><text start="113.287" dur="1.422">that Claude</text><text start="113.724" dur="1.513">calls &amp;#39;Dreaming&amp;#39;</text><text start="114.252" dur="1.589">,</text><text start="114.856" dur="1.347">which I&amp;#39;ll show you in this</text><text start="115.218" dur="1.317">video.</text><text start="115.55" dur="1.559"></text><text start="116.209" dur="1.537">You can let the world&amp;#39;s</text><text start="116.762" dur="1.285">most</text><text start="117.062" dur="1.427">powerful</text><text start="117.505" dur="1.585">model</text><text start="118.106" dur="1.538">think about</text><text start="118.66" dur="1.348"></text><text start="119.023" dur="1.443">how it can</text><text start="119.482" dur="1.538"></text><text start="120.035" dur="1.601">improve your life</text><text start="120.652" dur="1.459">, based on</text><text start="121.127" dur="1.348">its conversations with you.</text><text start="121.49" dur="1.585"></text><text start="122.091" dur="1.491"></text><text start="122.682" dur="1.453">So it can do</text><text start="123.152" dur="1.453"></text><text start="123.622" dur="1.68"></text><text start="124.319" dur="1.453">these tasks automatically for you.</text><text start="124.789" dur="1.71">And the</text><text start="125.517" dur="1.645"></text><text start="126.179" dur="1.61"></text><text start="126.806" dur="1.436"></text><text start="127.259" dur="1.68">reason it&amp;#39;s better than just keeping it in the cloud is because the</text><text start="127.956" dur="1.541">cloud is great,</text><text start="128.514" dur="1.436">but it&amp;#39;s only</text><text start="128.967" dur="1.593"></text><text start="129.577" dur="1.662">a part of your life.</text><text start="130.239" dur="1.594">You are using other</text><text start="130.851" dur="1.495">software,</text><text start="131.363" dur="1.601">other AI.</text><text start="131.982" dur="1.653"></text><text start="132.635" dur="1.342">Maybe you&amp;#39;re</text><text start="132.992" dur="1.518"></text><text start="133.525" dur="1.596">using ChatGPT,</text><text start="134.137" dur="1.533">maybe you&amp;#39;re using Hermes.</text><text start="134.685" dur="1.58"></text><text start="135.265" dur="1.724">You</text><text start="136.006" dur="1.576"></text><text start="136.599" dur="1.525"></text><text start="137.141" dur="1.788">should use Hermes at least a little.  Everyone</text><text start="137.957" dur="1.728">should.  The basic</text><text start="138.707" dur="1.692">idea is that no matter what</text><text start="139.421" dur="1.843">happens</text><text start="140.264" dur="1.779">, we can ask Cloud to keep an</text><text start="141.064" dur="1.671"></text><text start="141.756" dur="1.757">eye on everything and</text><text start="142.535" dur="1.735">make suggestions</text><text start="143.292" dur="1.714">, and</text><text start="144.027" dur="1.606">then we will have</text><text start="144.655" dur="1.692"></text><text start="145.368" dur="1.584"></text><text start="145.974" dur="1.541">a</text><text start="146.536" dur="1.736">place to manage the entire AI world.</text><text start="147.372" dur="1.777">Now, this brings us</text><text start="148.169" dur="1.18">very</text><text start="148.369" dur="1.598">nicely to</text><text start="148.987" dur="1.618"></text><text start="149.625" dur="1.698">what</text><text start="150.343" dur="1.558">we</text><text start="150.921" dur="1.598">call Level One, which is</text><text start="151.539" dur="1.658">effectively</text><text start="152.217" dur="1.778"></text><text start="153.015" dur="1.718"></text><text start="153.753" dur="1.625">giving control to the closed Fable 5.  And by</text><text start="154.397" dur="1.667"></text><text start="155.083" dur="1.704">giving control, I</text><text start="155.806" dur="1.445">mean</text><text start="156.269" dur="1.519"></text><text start="156.807" dur="1.445"></text><text start="157.27" dur="1.686"></text><text start="157.975" dur="1.723">adding Fable 5 to our main operating system.    The</text><text start="158.798" dur="1.544">first thing we&amp;#39;ll do with</text><text start="159.358" dur="1.513">him</text><text start="159.887" dur="1.513">is</text><text start="160.416" dur="1.497"></text><text start="160.929" dur="1.609">look at our whole world and</text><text start="161.554" dur="1.144"></text><text start="161.714" dur="1.481"></text><text start="162.211" dur="1.561">find the skills</text><text start="162.788" dur="1.401">we</text><text start="163.205" dur="1.497"></text><text start="163.718" dur="1.497">should be using but are</text><text start="164.231" dur="1.561">n&amp;#39;t.</text><text start="164.892" dur="1.646">So what I&amp;#39;m going to do is</text><text start="165.555" dur="1.58"></text><text start="166.151" dur="1.415"></text><text start="166.582" dur="1.398"></text><text start="166.997" dur="1.564">move to a closed code operating system.  There</text><text start="167.577" dur="1.584"></text><text start="168.182" dur="1.331"></text><text start="168.533" dur="1.558"></text><text start="169.112" dur="1.785"></text><text start="169.918" dur="1.717">are now many ways to access Fable 5.</text><text start="170.656" dur="1.45">The day you watch this</text><text start="171.126" dur="1.43">video</text><text start="171.576" dur="1.717">, you</text><text start="172.313" dur="1.573">may</text><text start="172.906" dur="1.758"></text><text start="173.684" dur="1.634"></text><text start="174.339" dur="1.716">only have</text><text start="175.076" dur="1.777">one day left to use it within the Cloud app.</text><text start="175.853" dur="1.997">After that, everything will be done</text><text start="176.874" dur="1.358"></text><text start="177.256" dur="1.788"></text><text start="178.068" dur="1.812">through API access.</text><text start="178.98" dur="1.517">Now the harness I&amp;#39;m going to</text><text start="179.515" dur="1.482"></text><text start="180.014" dur="1.571"></text><text start="180.603" dur="1.321"></text><text start="180.942" dur="1.607">use to access it is the</text><text start="181.567" dur="1.624"></text><text start="182.209" dur="1.375">Hermes</text><text start="182.602" dur="1.707">Agent.  You can use it</text><text start="183.329" dur="1.659">directly if you want.</text><text start="184.007" dur="1.601"></text><text start="184.627" dur="1.602"></text><text start="185.329" dur="1.493">But Hermes</text><text start="185.838" dur="1.286"></text><text start="186.14" dur="1.478"></text><text start="186.634" dur="1.239"></text><text start="186.889" dur="1.382"></text><text start="187.287" dur="1.573">gives us incredible additional benefits, which</text><text start="187.876" dur="1.557">we only</text><text start="188.449" dur="1.43"></text><text start="188.894" dur="1.59">get through using it.</text><text start="189.584" dur="1.47">So you see below</text><text start="190.069" dur="1.545"></text><text start="190.628" dur="1.471">I have this</text><text start="191.114" dur="1.177">model</text><text start="191.305" dur="1.442">selector</text><text start="191.761" dur="1.413">, right?</text><text start="192.274" dur="2.502">GPT 5.5.  And</text><text start="193.795" dur="1.361">this will</text><text start="194.175" dur="1.703">change it.</text><text start="194.878" dur="1.533">I</text><text start="195.426" dur="1.451"></text><text start="195.892" dur="1.645">have a ministry.  I</text><text start="196.556" dur="1.671">will show you what this means later.</text><text start="197.246" dur="1.709">It is very</text><text start="197.975" dur="1.595">powerful.</text><text start="198.67" dur="2.549">GLM 5.2 Opus</text><text start="200.258" dur="1.787">4.8.  I have</text><text start="201.064" dur="1.618"></text><text start="201.702" dur="1.676">to add Claude Fable 5.</text><text start="202.478" dur="1.567">So, how do we</text><text start="203.064" dur="1.606"></text><text start="203.69" dur="1.865">do that?  I will go to Claude.</text><text start="204.555" dur="1.569"></text><text start="205.224" dur="1.926">Excellent.  Now,</text><text start="206.167" dur="1.43">I&amp;#39;m inside the Cloud</text><text start="206.614" dur="1.362">Desktop</text><text start="206.993" dur="1.637">app</text><text start="207.647" dur="1.344">, which</text><text start="208.008" dur="1.465"></text><text start="208.49" dur="1.482"></text><text start="208.989" dur="1.379"></text><text start="209.385" dur="1.31"></text><text start="209.712" dur="1.619"></text><text start="210.348" dur="1.728">requires a $20 monthly subscription to access.  So,</text><text start="211.098" dur="1.536">I&amp;#39;ll</text><text start="211.656" dur="1.772"></text><text start="212.45" dur="1.773">come down here for example and select</text><text start="213.244" dur="1.408"></text><text start="213.673" dur="1.816">Fable 5 by July 7th.</text><text start="214.51" dur="1.795"></text><text start="215.405" dur="1.671">Friends, they are</text><text start="216.095" dur="1.346"></text><text start="216.46" dur="1.576">tempting us.</text><text start="217.055" dur="1.518"></text><text start="217.593" dur="1.715">So,</text><text start="218.325" dur="1.604">I do</text><text start="218.929" dur="1.655">n&amp;#39;t need Max.</text><text start="219.584" dur="1.756"></text><text start="220.358" dur="1.553">I only</text><text start="220.928" dur="1.672">need low for this job.  And</text><text start="221.617" dur="1.594">effectively, what</text><text start="222.228" dur="1.507">I&amp;#39;m going to do</text><text start="222.752" dur="1.612">is the</text><text start="223.381" dur="1.472">following.</text><text start="223.953" dur="1.655">Listen, I want</text><text start="224.628" dur="1.695">you to look at my code</text><text start="225.343" dur="1.676">code agentic</text><text start="226.039" dur="1.477">operating</text><text start="226.535" dur="1.537">system</text><text start="227.092" dur="1.457">, and in the</text><text start="227.569" dur="1.735">hardware section</text><text start="228.324" dur="1.556">where I can</text><text start="228.9" dur="1.735">select the model</text><text start="229.655" dur="1.516">,</text><text start="230.191" dur="1.755">I want</text><text start="230.966" dur="1.755">you to</text><text start="231.741" dur="1.636">add Fable 5 for me</text><text start="232.397" dur="1.596">, and I</text><text start="233.013" dur="1.695">want you to add</text><text start="233.728" dur="1.616">effort</text><text start="234.364" dur="1.755">dial for me and anything else</text><text start="235.138" dur="1.616"></text><text start="235.774" dur="1.636">that</text><text start="236.43" dur="1.636">you think might be</text><text start="237.086" dur="1.695"></text><text start="237.801" dur="1.437">helpful or</text><text start="238.258" dur="1.596">relevant to doing this.    Go ahead</text><text start="238.874" dur="1.497"></text><text start="239.471" dur="1.722">and</text><text start="240.214" dur="1.784"></text><text start="241.019" dur="1.824"