n about your business goals, your financial statements, what you talked about yesterday or a year ago, and what was discussed in the meeting with Billy Bob and Suzy McCoo a few days ago -</text><text start="486.864" dur="1.684">that would be</text><text start="487.571" dur="1.775">amazing.</text><text start="488.446" dur="1.472">You&amp;#39;d</text><text start="488.936" dur="1.586">never have to repeat yourself again</text><text start="489.541" dur="1.17"></text><text start="489.729" dur="1.624"></text><text start="490.371" dur="1.737">and</text><text start="491.127" dur="1.717">you&amp;#39;d always get the</text><text start="491.863" dur="1.472">best insights from it</text><text start="492.354" dur="1.68"></text><text start="493.053" dur="1.598">. So</text><text start="493.669" dur="1.422"></text><text start="494.109" dur="1.422"></text><text start="494.549" dur="1.545"></text><text start="495.112" dur="1.528"></text><text start="495.658" dur="1.669">one of the things you do in the agentic operating system is</text><text start="496.344" dur="1.546"></text><text start="496.907" dur="1.476"></text><text start="497.4" dur="1.44"></text><text start="497.858" dur="1.599">connect it to your Obsidian bot.</text><text start="498.557" dur="1.416">You want to</text><text start="498.988" dur="1.551"></text><text start="499.554" dur="1.283"></text><text start="499.852" dur="1.402"></text><text start="500.269" dur="1.416">link it to every one of your core code systems</text><text start="500.7" dur="1.477">and</text><text start="501.192" dur="1.312"></text><text start="501.519" dur="1.506"></text><text start="502.04" dur="1.372"></text><text start="502.427" dur="1.402"></text><text start="502.844" dur="1.759"></text><text start="503.618" dur="1.477"></text><text start="504.11" dur="1.327"></text><text start="504.452" dur="1.551"></text><text start="505.018" dur="1.506">connect it to everything that&amp;#39;s going on with your AI personal assistant, like the Hermes agent.</text><text start="505.539" dur="1.693">So you&amp;#39;ll see as you go down and</text><text start="506.251" dur="1.641"></text><text start="506.911" dur="1.491">you can connect all of these</text><text start="507.421" dur="1.528">things to</text><text start="507.967" dur="1.529">each other</text><text start="508.514" dur="1.642"></text><text start="509.174" dur="1.756">. Now</text><text start="509.959" dur="1.922">what I</text><text start="510.91" dur="2.123">want to do here is</text><text start="512.033" dur="2.009">basically go to Fable 5 and</text><text start="513.071" dur="2.066">say, this is</text><text start="514.166" dur="1.634">my</text><text start="514.828" dur="1.519">memory</text><text start="515.376" dur="1.979">system. I</text><text start="516.376" dur="1.791">want you to  Think about</text><text start="517.188" dur="1.646">how we</text><text start="517.855" dur="1.52"></text><text start="518.396" dur="1.583"></text><text start="519" dur="1.792">can improve it and make it</text><text start="519.812" dur="1.188">more</text><text start="520.021" dur="1.937">interactive</text><text start="520.979" dur="1.729">and easier to use</text><text start="521.729" dur="1.729"></text><text start="522.478" dur="1.75">, so that I</text><text start="523.249" dur="1.25"></text><text start="523.52" dur="1.687"></text><text start="524.228" dur="1.583"></text><text start="524.832" dur="1.624">can improve the whole system. Because</text><text start="525.474" dur="1.476"></text><text start="525.967" dur="1.441">one of the great things about the Obsidian bot</text><text start="526.426" dur="1.6"></text><text start="527.043" dur="1.37">is—I&amp;#39;ll</text><text start="527.431" dur="1.653"></text><text start="528.101" dur="1.6">put a link on the screen</text><text start="528.718" dur="1.565">if you don&amp;#39;t know</text><text start="529.3" dur="1.547">about it or</text><text start="529.865" dur="1.67">how it works</text><text start="530.552" dur="1.688"></text><text start="531.24" dur="1.67">—so you can learn about those</text><text start="531.928" dur="1.423">Kapathy</text><text start="532.369" dur="1.74">principles</text><text start="533.127" dur="1.6">.</text><text start="533.827" dur="1.368">But the basic</text><text start="534.214" dur="1.602">idea is that</text><text start="534.835" dur="1.485">you&amp;#39;re creating a</text><text start="535.339" dur="1.66">local LLM</text><text start="536.018" dur="1.485">wiki</text><text start="536.523" dur="1.678">that you</text><text start="537.221" dur="1.291"></text><text start="537.531" dur="1.524"></text><text start="538.074" dur="1.602"></text><text start="538.695" dur="1.233"></text><text start="538.947" dur="1.524"></text><text start="539.49" dur="1.816">can access with any information you need. And the</text><text start="540.325" dur="1.285"></text><text start="540.629" dur="1.686">important</text><text start="541.334" dur="1.686">thing here is that both Claude</text><text start="542.039" dur="1.59">and Hermes</text><text start="542.648" dur="1.476"></text><text start="543.143" dur="1.4"></text><text start="543.562" dur="1.514"></text><text start="544.095" dur="1.667">can access the same database, and</text><text start="544.781" dur="1.476">whenever you</text><text start="545.276" dur="1.533"></text><text start="545.828" dur="1.61">ask them a question,</text><text start="546.457" dur="1.666">they can pull information from that wiki</text><text start="547.142" dur="1.476"></text><text start="547.637" dur="1.591"></text><text start="548.247" dur="1.286">.</text><text start="548.633" dur="1.747">For example,</text><text start="549.4" dur="1.445">I can go</text><text start="549.865" dur="1.768">to my Agentic OS and</text><text start="550.653" dur="1.789">say,</text><text start="551.442" dur="1.282">&amp;quot;Go to my</text><text start="551.745" dur="1.545">Obsidian</text><text start="552.31" dur="1.768">wiki and</text><text start="553.099" dur="1.687"></text><text start="553.806" dur="1.364"></text><text start="554.19" dur="1.748"></text><text start="554.958" dur="1.566"></text><text start="555.544" dur="1.768">remind me of the three best principles for creating intros for YouTube videos.&amp;quot;</text><text start="556.332" dur="1.67">&amp;quot;</text><text start="557.019" dur="1.5">For example, how do I</text><text start="557.537" dur="1.586"></text><text start="558.14" dur="1.586">make a great intro</text><text start="558.744" dur="1.732">? In reality,</text><text start="559.495" dur="1.542">you</text><text start="560.056" dur="1.6"></text><text start="560.675" dur="1.788">can have anything.&amp;quot;  And</text><text start="561.475" dur="1.356">just like that,</text><text start="561.842" dur="1.322">we see</text><text start="562.175" dur="1.356">we&amp;#39;ve got it</text><text start="562.543" dur="1.287">here.</text><text start="562.841" dur="1.532"></text><text start="563.388" dur="1.618">Start with the payoff</text><text start="564.006" dur="1.586">, not the setup.</text><text start="564.592" dur="1.445"></text><text start="565.051" dur="1.365"></text><text start="565.429" dur="1.514"></text><text start="565.957" dur="1.244">Keep the loop open for the first 10 seconds.</text><text start="566.301" dur="1.261"></text><text start="566.574" dur="1.386"></text><text start="566.973" dur="1.473"></text><text start="567.458" dur="1.424">Cut out everything that hinders building trust.</text><text start="567.982" dur="1.595">So, this is</text><text start="568.597" dur="1.699">very nice.    I</text><text start="569.396" dur="1.432"></text><text start="569.844" dur="1.185"></text><text start="570.045" dur="1.417"></text><text start="570.478" dur="1.432"></text><text start="570.926" dur="1.517">got it all from my Obsidian wiki.  And</text><text start="571.459" dur="1.433">here&amp;#39;s</text><text start="571.907" dur="1.541">another</text><text start="572.464" dur="1.526">nice thing I have</text><text start="573.005" dur="1.418">, which is an</text><text start="573.438" dur="1.433"></text><text start="573.887" dur="1.587">overview of my token spending,</text><text start="574.49" dur="1.541">so I know</text><text start="575.047" dur="1.525"></text><text start="575.588" dur="1.588">where I am in this conversation.</text><text start="576.276" dur="1.595">So, we will</text><text start="576.89" dur="1.632"></text><text start="577.541" dur="1.688"></text><text start="578.248" dur="1.632"></text><text start="578.899" dur="1.633"></text><text start="579.55" dur="1.782">give Fable a prompt to improve our memory system.  This is the</text><text start="580.353" dur="1.584">prompt</text><text start="580.958" dur="1.793">we will give it.</text><text start="581.751" dur="1.89">Hey, I want to improve the memory system of my</text><text start="582.663" dur="1.485">Cloud Code</text><text start="583.17" dur="1.529">Agentic</text><text start="583.721" dur="1.53">operating</text><text start="584.273" dur="1.595">system.</text><text start="584.89" dur="1.331"></text><text start="585.243" dur="1.727"></text><text start="585.993" dur="1.837"></text><text start="586.83" dur="1.648">It is connected to my</text><text start="587.5" dur="1.81">Obsidian or</text><text start="588.332" dur="1.81">Hermes chat</text><text start="589.163" dur="1.635">or Claude Code</text><text start="589.82" dur="1.744">chat.</text><text start="590.586" dur="1.792">I</text><text start="591.396" dur="1.703">want you to find a way to make it</text><text start="592.117" dur="1.832">interactive</text><text start="592.967" dur="1.518"></text><text start="593.503" dur="1.703"></text><text start="594.224" dur="1.407">so I can</text><text start="594.649" dur="1.388"></text><text start="595.056" dur="1.499"></text><text start="595.573" dur="1.647">click on different aspects and</text><text start="596.239" dur="1.647">extract that knowledge.</text><text start="596.904" dur="1.783">I</text><text start="597.705" dur="1.404">want you to be</text><text start="598.127" dur="1.697">creative and</text><text start="598.843" dur="1.697"></text><text start="599.559" dur="1.532">add a category that will</text><text start="600.109" dur="1.514"></text><text start="600.641" dur="1.276"></text><text start="600.935" dur="1.679"></text><text start="601.632" dur="1.624"></text><text start="602.275" dur="1.623">help me discover new aspects of my knowledge</text><text start="602.917" dur="1.642">and maybe</text><text start="603.577" dur="1.221">we can</text><text start="603.816" dur="1.661"></text><text start="604.495" dur="1.385"></text><text start="604.899" dur="1.44"></text><text start="605.358" dur="1.568">categorize and</text><text start="605.945" dur="1.495">cluster them according to the topic.</text><text start="606.459" dur="1.785">I</text><text start="607.263" dur="1.648"></text><text start="607.93" dur="1.514"></text><text start="608.463" dur="1.641">give you complete freedom.  I</text><text start="609.119" dur="1.545">want you to create something interesting to improve the memory system inside my</text><text start="609.68" dur="1.545">Agentic OS</text><text start="610.225" dur="1.592"></text><text start="610.833" dur="1.513"></text><text start="611.362" dur="1.436"></text><text start="611.814" dur="1.187"></text><text start="612.016" dur="1.421"></text><text start="612.452" dur="1.592"></text><text start="613.06" dur="1.592">and then we&amp;#39;ll</text><text start="613.667" dur="1.483">send it to you.</text><text start="614.166" dur="1.633">So</text><text start="614.818" dur="1.673">now Fable has</text><text start="615.511" dur="1.596">completed his work.</text><text start="616.126" dur="1.653">Let&amp;#39;s go</text><text start="616.796" dur="1.655">down and see</text><text start="617.468" dur="1.483"></text><text start="617.968" dur="1.655">what it did for us.</text><text start="618.723" dur="1.729">This is really very</text><text start="619.471" dur="1.576">interesting.</text><text start="620.147" dur="1.5"></text><text start="620.66" dur="1.462">Let me pull it up a little</text><text start="621.135" dur="1.408">so you</text><text start="621.556" dur="1.448"></text><text start="622.018" dur="1.448">can see it better.</text><text start="622.566" dur="1.715">Great.  So</text><text start="623.299" dur="1.598">what I&amp;#39;ve got here are</text><text start="623.916" dur="1.653"></text><text start="624.588" dur="1.523">all my</text><text start="625.129" dur="1.692">different wikis.</text><text start="625.921" dur="1.223"></text><text start="626.163" dur="1.56"></text><text start="626.741" dur="1.485"></text><text start="627.245" dur="1.522"></text><text start="627.786" dur="1.653">What my Obsidian Wiki, my YouTube, and Fable basically did was</text><text start="628.458" dur="1.597"></text><text start="629.073" dur="1.672"></text><text start="629.763" dur="1.448"></text><text start="630.23" dur="1.56">organize them thematically.</text><text start="630.89" dur="1.55">Like we</text><text start="631.458" dur="1.391">have</text><text start="631.867" dur="1.675">Callaway, Ed</text><text start="632.559" dur="1.338">Lawrence,</text><text start="632.915" dur="1.604"></text><text start="633.536" dur="1.391">a great</text><text start="633.945" dur="1.604">guy in Dubai who</text><text start="634.567" dur="1.55"></text><text start="635.135" dur="1.622">talks a lot about YouTube strategy</text><text start="635.775" dur="1.568">, Patty</text><text start="636.361" dur="1.533">Galloway</text><text start="636.912" dur="1.604">hooks YouTube.</text><text start="637.616" dur="1.338">So these</text><text start="637.98" dur="1.78">threads come up</text><text start="638.786" dur="1.91">more frequently.</text><text start="639.722" dur="1.614">I</text><text start="640.358" dur="1.762"></text><text start="641.142" dur="1.874"></text><text start="642.038" dur="1.695">can expand and see 15 more topics.</text><text start="642.833" dur="1.97">Really great.</text><text start="643.903" dur="1.62">If I</text><text start="644.542" dur="1.756">come down and say I</text><text start="645.317" dur="1.407"></text><text start="645.744" dur="1.658"></text><text start="646.422" dur="1.543">want to know more about retention.</text><text start="647.065" dur="1.379">So I</text><text start="647.458" dur="1.325"></text><text start="647.797" dur="1.42">clicked on retention</text><text start="648.231" dur="1.474">and</text><text start="648.719" dur="1.284">various</text><text start="649.017" dur="1.339">concepts and</text><text start="649.37" dur="1.488">frameworks came to me.</text><text start="649.871" dur="1.694">Very</text><text start="650.589" dur="1.741">nice.  I</text><text start="651.344" dur="1.469"></text><text start="651.827" dur="1.387"></text><text start="652.228" dur="1.442">can click on them further and</text><text start="652.684" dur="1.525">get more information</text><text start="653.222" dur="1.429">that is</text><text start="653.665" dur="1.483">connected to the intro,</text><text start="654.162" dur="1.539">and now I&amp;#39;m</text><text start="654.714" dur="1.373"></text><text start="655.101" dur="1.484">back to the intro and</text><text start="655.599" dur="1.345">I have</text><text start="655.958" dur="1.511">Business YouTube.</text><text start="656.483" dur="1.573">I can click on it</text><text start="657.072" dur="1.453"></text><text start="657.541" dur="1.615">and</text><text start="658.172" dur="1.615">click away like this.</text><text start="658.803" dur="1.514">And</text><text start="659.336" dur="1.745">yes, I just</text><text start="660.1" dur="1.401"></text><text start="660.52" dur="1.669">gave the prompt and it</text><text start="661.208" dur="1.42"></text><text start="661.647" dur="1.707">did all this on its own.</text><text start="662.454" dur="1.552">I even</text><text start="663.026" dur="1.552"></text><text start="663.598" dur="1.781">have a search bar.  I can</text><text start="664.399" dur="1.769">search for everything.</text><text start="665.189" dur="1.798">If I</text><text start="666.007" dur="1.753"></text><text start="666.781" dur="1.651">want to learn about hooks and</text><text start="667.452" dur="1.183"></text><text start="667.655" dur="1.794"></text><text start="668.469" dur="1.774">see it dynamically, guys.</text><text start="669.343" dur="1.236">This is</text><text start="669.606" dur="1.868">incredible.</text><text start="670.574" dur="1.974">This is madness.</text><text start="671.648" dur="1.342">This is</text><text start="672.008" dur="1.559">retention and</text><text start="672.585" dur="1.577">now it&amp;#39;s like my</text><text start="673.18" dur="1.486">personal</text><text start="673.684" dur="1.667">database</text><text start="674.369" dur="1.505">where I can</text><text start="674.892" dur="1.685"></text><text start="675.595" dur="1.559">search for all my memories.</text><text start="676.172" dur="1.683">So</text><text start="676.872" dur="1.591">you can see</text><text start="677.48" dur="1.365"></text><text start="677.862" dur="1.66">how Fable 5</text><text start="678.54" dur="1.538"></text><text start="679.095" dur="1.261"></text><text start="679.373" dur="1.591"></text><text start="679.981" dur="1.643"></text><text start="680.641" dur="1.486">takes this agentic memory system to a whole new level.</text><text start="681.145" dur="1.627">But</text><text start="681.79" dur="1.507">it takes us to a more powerful level with our</text><text start="682.315" dur="1.506">Cloud Fable</text><text start="682.839" dur="1.633">Agentic OS,</text><text start="683.472" dur="1.687"></text><text start="684.177" dur="1.615"></text><text start="684.81" dur="1.687"></text><text start="685.516" dur="1.47">and that is</text><text start="686.004" dur="1.597">Ministry.</text><text start="686.701" dur="1.437">I called it the</text><text start="687.156" dur="1.473">agents&amp;#39;</text><text start="687.646" dur="1.526">ministry.</text><text start="688.189" dur="1.739">Some</text><text start="688.945" dur="1.665">say Jack, it&amp;#39;s</text><text start="689.627" dur="1.204">actually a</text><text start="689.848" dur="1.461"></text><text start="690.326" dur="1.627">mix of agents.  I&amp;#39;m</text><text start="690.971" dur="1.432">saying, hey,</text><text start="691.422" dur="1.564">Ministry is</text><text start="692.005" dur="1.714">much cooler.</text><text start="692.819" dur="1.671"></text><text start="693.509" dur="1.614">What do I mean by this?</text><text start="694.223" dur="1.406">Let me</text><text start="694.648" dur="1.684"></text><text start="695.35" dur="1.592">show you straight away what it&amp;#39;s all</text><text start="695.961" dur="1.721">about, because it&amp;#39;s</text><text start="696.7" dur="1.573">really</text><text start="697.292" dur="1.804">important to understand.  If I</text><text start="698.117" dur="1.663"></text><text start="698.801" dur="1.435"></text><text start="699.256" dur="1.663">come to the Hermes Agent on the left,</text><text start="699.94" dur="1.643">this is</text><text start="700.603" dur="1.373"></text><text start="700.997" dur="1.767">a</text><text start="701.784" dur="1.705">nice feature released by Hermes</text><text start="702.51" dur="1.518">that is on a few</text><text start="703.048" dur="1.643">different models.</text><text start="703.712" dur="1.695">You</text><text start="704.425" dur="1.463"></text><text start="704.906" dur="1.703"></text><text start="705.628" dur="1.574">can do this on your agentic OS.</text><text start="706.302" dur="1.787">If you come here to the</text><text start="707.11" dur="1.767">Ministry of</text><text start="707.897" dur="1.622">Experts</text><text start="708.54" dur="1.808">model, the</text><text start="709.369" dur="1.663">basic idea</text><text start="710.053" dur="1.787">is that you have an</text><text start="710.861" dur="1.871">orchestrating</text><text start="711.752" dur="1.809">agent, right</text><text start="712.581" dur="1.87">?  You have a</text><text start="713.473" dur="1.646">model that is</text><text start="714.142" dur="1.401"></text><text start="714.565" dur="1.825">taking care of everything.</text><text start="715.39" dur="1.729">And when you</text><text start="716.139" dur="1.427"></text><text start="716.585" dur="1.737">ask it a question or</text><text start="717.342" dur="1.679"></text><text start="718.04" dur="1.757">ask it to generate code, it can even be</text><text start="718.816" dur="1.544"></text><text start="719.379" dur="1.757">about your life,</text><text start="720.155" dur="1.66">like—which</text><text start="720.834" dur="1.583">coffee shop should I go to?</text><text start="721.517" dur="1.682">Because we all</text><text start="722.216" dur="1.629">know, friends,</text><text start="722.863" dur="1.502"></text><text start="723.383" dur="1.557">this is the most</text><text start="723.957" dur="1.647">important</text><text start="724.622" dur="1.869">question today.  What it will</text><text start="725.516" dur="1.737">do is</text><text start="726.277" dur="1.762"></text><text start="727.063" dur="1.614"></text><text start="727.702" dur="1.835">ask three different models this question.</text><text start="728.637" dur="2.118">For example,</text><text start="729.785" dur="2.058">I have</text><text start="730.873" dur="1.877">DeepSec V4</text><text start="731.78" dur="1.967">Pro, GLM</text><text start="732.778" dur="1.755">5.2, Two and</text><text start="733.563" dur="2.028">Chat GPT</text><text start="734.621" dur="1.454">5.5, which</text><text start="735.105" dur="1.816">incidentally is</text><text start="735.951" dur="2.119">very token-</text><text start="737.1" dur="1.957">efficient.  This</text><text start="738.079" dur="1.263">whole</text><text start="738.364" dur="1.593">system</text><text start="738.979" dur="1.745"></text><text start="739.746" dur="1.746">saves you a lot of tokens</text><text start="740.514" dur="1.571">and it</text><text start="741.107" dur="1.614">looks at all the answers to</text><text start="741.743" dur="1.746">find the best one</text><text start="742.511" dur="1.724">, then</text><text start="743.256" dur="1.615">adjusts it to</text><text start="743.893" dur="1.614"></text><text start="744.529" dur="1.548"></text><text start="745.099" dur="1.942">give you a better answer.  So</text><text start="746.066" dur="1.733">what we&amp;#39;re going to do now</text><text start="746.824" dur="1.961"></text><text start="747.81" dur="1.227">is</text><text start="748.063" dur="1.985"></text><text start="749.074" dur="1.884"></text><text start="749.983" dur="1.986">add Fable 5 as an orchestrator, because</text><text start="750.994" dur="1.935">Opus 4.8 is</text><text start="751.955" dur="1.916">no longer king.  So</text><text start="752.892" dur="1.697">we&amp;#39;ll simply</text><text start="753.609" dur="1.718"></text><text start="754.348" dur="1.779">remove it from here and</text><text start="755.147" dur="1.657">then find Fable 5.</text><text start="755.824" dur="1.78"></text><text start="756.704" dur="1.641">Since we ca</text><text start="757.366" dur="1.808"></text><text start="758.195" dur="1.704"></text><text start="758.919" dur="1.622">n&amp;#39;t see Fable 5 on the left, we&amp;#39;ll</text><text start="759.561" dur="1.808">go to Cloud and add it.</text><text start="760.39" dur="1.58"></text><text start="761.07" dur="1.552">Then come back and</text><text start="761.638" dur="1.6">explain to Claude</text><text start="762.253" dur="1.506">that you</text><text start="762.774" dur="1.6"></text><text start="763.39" dur="1.521">want to add it, if you haven&amp;#39;t</text><text start="763.927" dur="1.521">already.</text><text start="764.463" dur="1.499">And</text><text start="764.975" dur="1.485">literally,</text><text start="765.472" dur="1.319">you should add it</text><text start="765.804" dur="1.472"></text><text start="766.288" dur="1.434">to the Ministry of Experts.</text><text start="766.735" dur="1.484"></text><text start="767.219" dur="1.434">Of course,</text><text start="767.668" dur="1.528">I</text><text start="768.212" dur="1.388">added it to mine.</text><text start="768.616" dur="1.896">Excellent.</text><text start="769.512" dur="1.544">Simply</text><text start="770.073" dur="1.409"></text><text start="770.499" dur="1.63">return to the operating system.</text><text start="771.146" dur="1.256"></text><text start="771.502" dur="1.651"></text><text start="772.17" dur="1.669">Come to the Ministry of Agents.</text><text start="772.839" dur="1.753">And now</text><text start="773.612" dur="1.683">what we&amp;#39;re going to do is</text><text start="774.316" dur="1.62">remove 4.8.</text><text start="774.957" dur="1.656">Then</text><text start="775.633" dur="1.634">we will be able to</text><text start="776.288" dur="1.654">add the wonderful Fable 5.</text><text start="776.962" dur="1.778"></text><text start="777.84" dur="1.989">And this is it.</text><text start="778.929" dur="1.742">I&amp;#39;m bringing it.</text><text start="779.694" dur="1.81">So from now on,</text><text start="780.523" dur="1.667">this will be the</text><text start="781.209" dur="1.744">orchestrator</text><text start="781.953" dur="1.458">, which is great.</text><text start="782.43" dur="1.744">And</text><text start="783.195" dur="1.519">then we will</text><text start="783.735" dur="1.312"></text><text start="784.067" dur="1.623"></text><text start="784.711" dur="1.665">save it on the computer.</text><text start="785.476" dur="1.636">If you have</text><text start="786.132" dur="1.636">n&amp;#39;t added it before</text><text start="786.788" dur="1.716">,</text><text start="787.524" dur="1.696">just come down and</text><text start="788.24" dur="1.636">copy it</text><text start="788.896" dur="1.497">and</text><text start="789.413" dur="1.736">drop it into the chat window</text><text start="790.169" dur="1.596">, which is what I&amp;#39;m</text><text start="790.785" dur="1.617">doing here.</text><text start="791.502" dur="1.714">So that you get some idea of</text><text start="792.236" dur="1.776">how it works.</text><text start="793.033" dur="1.633"></text><text start="793.686" dur="1.694"></text><text start="794.401" dur="1.633">And</text><text start="795.056" dur="1.754"></text><text start="795.832" dur="1.466"></text><text start="796.32" dur="1.755"></text><text start="797.097" dur="1.621">a great</text><text start="797.74" dur="1.732">reason to use Hermes for this chat is that it</text><text start="798.494" dur="1.555">actually caches the</text><text start="799.071" dur="1.821">prompts for everyone.</text><text start="799.914" dur="1.843"></text><text start="800.757" dur="1.988">Normally,</text><text start="801.768" dur="1.798">if you wanted to do a negative</text><text start="802.589" dur="1.704">review</text><text start="803.316" dur="1.54">,</text><text start="803.879" dur="1.868">meaning DeepSec</text><text start="804.771" dur="1.657"></text><text start="805.451" dur="1.751">would give an answer, GLM</text><text start="806.225" dur="1.657"></text><text start="806.906" dur="1.75">would give an answer, GPT</text><text start="807.68" dur="1.844">5.5</text><text start="808.548" dur="1.54">would give an answer,</text><text start="809.111" dur="1.422">we would have to</text><text start="809.557" dur="1.492"></text><text start="810.073" dur="1.868"></text><text start="810.964" dur="1.728">pay for all of those tokens.</text><text start="811.715" dur="1.587"></text><text start="812.402" dur="1.56">But we</text><text start="812.98" dur="1.451">actually use a</text><text start="813.45" dur="1.325">cache</text><text start="813.793" dur="1.687">which will</text><text start="814.498" dur="1.56"></text><text start="815.076" dur="1.668">save us a lot of tokens.</text><text start="815.762" dur="1.578">And</text><text start="816.363" dur="1.849">obviously we are</text><text start="817.235" dur="1.872"></text><text start="818.13" dur="1.827"></text><text start="818.98" dur="1.734"></text><text start="819.737" dur="1.413"></text><text start="820.173" dur="1.85">using Open Router for DeepSeq, GLM and GPT 5.5.</text><text start="821.123" dur="1.647">We are</text><text start="821.791" dur="1.71">using our Orith</text><text start="822.522" dur="1.397">which is</text><text start="822.94" dur="1.668">fantastic,</text><text start="823.629" dur="1.647">meaning you will have to</text><text start="824.297" dur="1.648"></text><text start="824.965" dur="1.732">spend very little.</text><text start="825.797" dur="1.922">It is very cheap.</text><text start="826.719" dur="1.621">If you have never</text><text start="827.353" dur="1.474"></text><text start="827.84" dur="1.474"></text><text start="828.326" dur="1.487">used this Ministry of Experts</text><text start="828.826" dur="1.461">, I will</text><text start="829.3" dur="1.154"></text><text start="829.467" dur="1.345"></text><text start="829.825" dur="1.487">provide a link to the entire system.</text><text start="830.312" dur="1.637">But</text><text start="830.967" dur="1.677">using Fable 5 in this is</text><text start="831.662" dur="1.605">really a</text><text start="832.285" dur="1.606">game changer.</text><text start="832.991" dur="1.609">And you can see</text><text start="833.616" dur="1.498">it&amp;#39;s</text><text start="834.13" dur="1.433">already done.</text><text start="834.579" dur="1.337"></text><text start="834.932" dur="1.768">It</text><text start="835.723" dur="1.595">already</text><text start="836.34" dur="1.773">had the right information</text><text start="837.135" dur="1.879">which is nice.  And</text><text start="838.032" dur="1.591">what I&amp;#39;ll do is come down to</text><text start="838.64" dur="1.287">this</text><text start="838.945" dur="1.645">selector</text><text start="839.608" dur="1.573">and</text><text start="840.199" dur="1.214">let&amp;#39;s</text><text start="840.431" dur="1.538"></text><text start="840.987" dur="1.626">select Ministry,</text><text start="841.631" dur="1.394">which is</text><text start="842.043" dur="1.537"></text><text start="842.598" dur="1.484"></text><text start="843.1" dur="1.501">a quick</text><text start="843.619" dur="1.993">way to use three experts.  And I&amp;#39;ll</text><text start="844.642" dur="2.08">say, &amp;quot;That&amp;#39;s</text><text start="845.752" dur="2.13">great. Can you</text><text start="846.908" dur="1.721">tell me</text><text start="847.655" dur="1.772"></text><text start="848.453" dur="1.876"></text><text start="849.355" dur="1.824"></text><text start="850.205" dur="1.875"></text><text start="851.106" dur="1.953"></text><text start="852.085" dur="1.876"></text><text start="852.986" dur="1.721"></text><text start="853.733" dur="2.005">what&amp;#39;s the best country in the world to live in for someone in their early 30s, with beautiful spring weather, and who loves coffee?</text><text start="854.738" dur="1.999">&amp;quot; Okay.  And</text><text start="855.757" dur="1.625">basically it will now</text><text start="856.401" dur="1.293"></text><text start="856.714" dur="1.723"></text><text start="857.456" dur="1.723"></text><text start="858.199" dur="1.605"></text><text start="858.824" dur="1.83">start a debate with all the Ministry of Experts.  And</text><text start="859.675" dur="1.714">basically it&amp;#39;s back</text><text start="860.41" dur="1.673">, it&amp;#39;s</text><text start="861.104" dur="1.694">ended the big debate.</text><text start="861.818" dur="1.654">We</text><text start="862.488" dur="1.467"></text><text start="862.971" dur="1.482"></text><text start="863.469" dur="1.389">did a cafe at Alchemist and the</text><text start="863.874" dur="1.389">result is the</text><text start="864.279" dur="1.607">Netherlands</text><text start="864.886" dur="1.42">, especially</text><text start="865.322" dur="1.545">Utrecht, which is</text><text start="865.883" dur="1.576">quite interesting.</text><text start="866.459" dur="1.635">So, if you are</text><text start="867.109" dur="1.138"></text><text start="867.262" dur="1.596"></text><text start="867.873" dur="1.596">from the Netherlands, let</text><text start="868.484" dur="1.336"></text><text start="868.835" dur="1.565">me</text><text start="869.416" dur="1.575">know in the comments below.  I am</text><text start="870.013" dur="1.735">beautiful.  Just like</text><text start="870.766" dur="1.591">that, we</text><text start="871.376" dur="1.536"></text><text start="871.93" dur="1.333"></text><text start="872.281" dur="1.628"></text><text start="872.928" dur="1.702">got our prompt back from Fable 5, where all</text><text start="873.648" dur="1.573">three models</text><text start="874.24" dur="1.406"></text><text start="874.665" dur="1.646">debated it,</text><text start="875.33" dur="1.573">which is awesome.</text><text start="876.003" dur="1.875">GPT 5.5,</text><text start="876.91" dur="2.199">GLM 5.2, and</text><text start="878.142" dur="1.94">DeepSec V4</text><text start="879.114" dur="1.974">Pro.  So,</text><text start="880.108" dur="1.592">basically Fable 5 is</text><text start="880.72" dur="1.754"></text><text start="881.495" dur="1.55">controlling the whole thing.</text><text start="882.066" dur="1.703">And</text><text start="882.788" dur="1.633">under that we</text><text start="883.439" dur="1.521"></text><text start="883.979" dur="1.726">have sub-agents that are calling it</text><text start="884.723" dur="1.652">and we are</text><text start="885.393" dur="1.298"></text><text start="885.709" dur="1.503"></text><text start="886.231" dur="1.576"></text><text start="886.826" dur="1.521"></text><text start="887.366" dur="1.664">getting the best results from all those individual agents.  And</text><text start="888.05" dur="1.54">it fits very well with Fable 5 at Level 4 of our</text><text start="888.61" dur="1.463">Agentic</text><text start="889.093" dur="1.463">Operating</text><text start="889.576" dur="1.521">System.</text><text start="890.116" dur="1.696"></text><text start="890.831" dur="1.637"></text><text start="891.488" dur="1.656"></text><text start="892.164" dur="1.814">So,</text><text start="893.003" dur="1.889">it&amp;#39;s basically a</text><text start="893.917" dur="1.94">dream, right?</text><text start="894.957" dur="1.636">The dream is that</text><text start="895.612" dur="1.524">you are going to sleep with your</text><text start="896.155" dur="1.711">sleeping cap on.    I do</text><text start="896.885" dur="1.693"></text><text start="897.678" dur="1.872">n&amp;#39;t know who is</text><text start="898.574" dur="1.911">doing this now.  And</text><text start="899.508" dur="1.863">Fable 5 will work all night.</text><text start="900.394" dur="1.809">And</text><text start="901.219" dur="1.487">the idea is that</text><text start="901.722" dur="1.393">it will work on your</text><text start="902.131" dur="1.471">problems.</text><text start="902.618" dur="1.598"></text><text start="903.316" dur="1.377">It will think about</text><text start="903.708" dur="1.469">how we can</text><text start="904.192" dur="1.408"></text><text start="904.615" dur="1.423">improve things.</text><text start="905.053" dur="1.701">It will</text><text start="905.754" dur="1.636">create sub-agencies.</text><text start="906.409" dur="1.585">It will</text><text start="907.017" dur="1.796">work great.</text><text start="907.835" dur="1.809">Now we will</text><text start="908.661" dur="1.568"></text><text start="909.245" dur="1.401"></text><text start="909.663" dur="1.401"></text><text start="910.08" dur="1.618">reflect this in our operating system.</text><text start="910.698" dur="1.642">And this is</text><text start="911.357" dur="1.592">something</text><text start="911.966" dur="1.475">I highly recommend you</text><text start="912.457" dur="1.204">take.</text><text start="912.678" dur="1.457"></text><text start="913.152" dur="1.627"></text><text start="913.879" dur="1.689">And this idea is</text><text start="914.586" dur="1.109"></text><text start="914.713" dur="1.599">effectively</text><text start="915.331" dur="1.399"></text><text start="915.748" dur="1.508"></text><text start="916.274" dur="1.708">based on all this information, right</text><text start="917" dur="1.719">?  Cloud code</text><text start="917.737" dur="1.65">activity,</text><text start="918.404" dur="1.439">anti-</text><text start="918.843" dur="1.545">gravity,</text><text start="919.405" dur="1.562">memory files,</text><text start="919.985" dur="1.386">automation,</text><text start="920.389" dur="1.597">integration,</text><text start="921.003" dur="1.615">skills, chat</text><text start="921.635" dur="1.633">logs—Hermes has</text><text start="922.285" dur="1.65">everything you need to get back</text><text start="922.953" dur="1.614"></text><text start="923.585" dur="1.492">and dream.</text><text start="924.094" dur="1.78">So</text><text start="924.893" dur="1.624"></text><text start="925.536" dur="1.719">what we&amp;#39;re going to do effectively</text><text start="926.274" dur="1.738">is give it</text><text start="927.03" dur="1.53">a</text><text start="927.579" dur="1.719">prompt like this:</text><text start="928.317" dur="1.549">I&amp;#39;m</text><text start="928.884" dur="1.606">going to go to Claude and</text><text start="929.509" dur="1.586">say, &amp;quot;Hello,</text><text start="930.114" dur="1.643">I</text><text start="930.776" dur="1.511"></text><text start="931.306" dur="1.416"></text><text start="931.741" dur="1.454"></text><text start="932.214" dur="1.738"></text><text start="932.971" dur="1.662">want to see the dream functionality of the operating system and</text><text start="933.652" dur="1.605">I want you to</text><text start="934.276" dur="1.643"></text><text start="934.938" dur="1.681">improve it in some way; find ways to make this</text><text start="935.638" dur="1.284">dream</text><text start="935.941" dur="1.738">functionality</text><text start="936.698" dur="1.53">better.</text><text start="937.246" dur="1.606"></text><text start="937.871" dur="1.719"></text><text start="938.609" dur="1.8">&amp;quot; &amp;quot;</text><text start="939.425" dur="1.595">How can you review all of our</text><text start="940.036" dur="1.385">existing</text><text start="940.437" dur="1.45">data and</text><text start="940.903" dur="1.482"></text><text start="941.401" dur="1.45"></text><text start="941.867" dur="1.594"></text><text start="942.477" dur="1.45">take it to a whole new level</text><text start="942.943" dur="1.45"></text><text start="943.409" dur="1.305">so that</text><text start="943.73" dur="1.385"></text><text start="944.132" dur="1.497"></text><text start="944.646" dur="1.514">I</text><text start="945.176" dur="1.578"></text><text start="945.77" dur="1.672">can get better insights using these models? The</text><text start="946.467" dur="2.001"></text><text start="947.494" dur="1.616">levels of insight are</text><text start="948.136" dur="1.95">really cool.</text><text start="949.086" dur="1.65">&amp;quot;  Faber 5 has</text><text start="949.754" dur="1.501"></text><text start="950.273" dur="1.59"></text><text start="950.881" dur="1.394"></text><text start="951.293" dur="1.626">redesigned the entire Dream system;  It&amp;#39;s all about</text><text start="951.937" dur="1.698">how it works,</text><text start="952.653" dur="1.68">where it collects data from,</text><text start="953.351" dur="1.68">and</text><text start="954.049" dur="1.59"></text><text start="954.657" dur="1.663">how the suggestions come back to us.  The</text><text start="955.337" dur="1.627"></text><text start="955.982" dur="1.787"></text><text start="956.791" dur="1.684">model architecture behind it is also</text><text start="957.497" dur="1.927"></text><text start="958.446" dur="1.817">very interesting—</text><text start="959.263" dur="1.75">which models</text><text start="960.036" dur="1.816"></text><text start="960.874" dur="1.817">are working for the dream,</text><text start="961.713" dur="1.773">what data sources</text><text start="962.508" dur="1.64">are there, how</text><text start="963.17" dur="1.816">they</text><text start="964.008" dur="1.574">are combined, and it</text><text start="964.604" dur="1.685"></text><text start="965.311" dur="1.397"></text><text start="965.73" dur="1.552"></text><text start="966.304" dur="1.684"></text><text start="967.01" dur="1.71">shows you a nice overview and beautiful UI.  You</text><text start="967.738" dur="1.497"></text><text start="968.253" dur="1.585">can scroll down, and if you</text><text start="968.856" dur="1.39"></text><text start="969.264" dur="1.603"></text><text start="969.885" dur="1.514">want to get it done right away, you can also</text><text start="970.417" dur="1.443">copy it.</text><text start="970.878" dur="1.587"></text><text start="971.484" dur="1.653">You can remove it while working.</text><text start="972.156" dur="1.709"></text><text start="972.884" dur="1.631">This is</text><text start="973.537" dur="1.674">a really</text><text start="974.233" dur="1.586">powerful</text><text start="974.841" dur="1.764">feature.  Watching</text><text start="975.627" dur="1.703"></text><text start="976.353" dur="1.635">a super</text><text start="977.01" dur="1.817">intelligent</text><text start="977.849" dur="1.703">AI review</text><text start="978.575" dur="1.567">all your work while you sleep is</text><text start="979.165" dur="1.68"></text><text start="979.868" dur="1.861"></text><text start="980.752" dur="1.862">a great</text><text start="981.636" dur="1.781">benefit in my opinion.  This</text><text start="982.439" dur="1.635"></text><text start="983.097" dur="1.68"></text><text start="983.799" dur="1.726"></text><text start="984.547" dur="1.68">takes us nicely to Level Five, which</text><text start="985.25" dur="1.748">effectively</text><text start="986.021" dur="1.68"></text><text start="986.723" dur="1.839"></text><text start="987.585" dur="1.725"></text><text start="988.333" dur="1.702"></text><text start="989.058" dur="1.703">gives us the ability to follow the brain in Authentic OS.</text><text start="989.861" dur="1.986">So this is really</text><text start="990.872" dur="1.928">great.  But wouldn&amp;#39;t</text><text start="991.82" dur="1.52">it be</text><text start="992.36" dur="1.701">great</text><text start="993.081" dur="1.44">if we</text><text start="993.541" dur="1.48"></text><text start="994.041" dur="1.48"></text><text start="994.541" dur="1.541"></text><text start="995.102" dur="1.7"></text><text start="995.822" dur="1.86">could talk to the authentic operating system?  We will have our</text><text start="996.703" dur="1.654">own.</text><text start="997.378" dur="1.841">Some</text><text start="998.238" dur="1.629">call it Java,</text><text start="998.886" dur="1.704">some</text><text start="999.609" dur="1.495">call it Maverick, you can give it</text><text start="1000.124" dur="1.457"></text><text start="1000.6" dur="1.723">any cool name you like.</text><text start="1001.342" dur="1.591"></text><text start="1002.033" dur="1.678">But I think it would be</text><text start="1002.728" dur="1.383"></text><text start="1003.128" dur="1.522"></text><text start="1003.667" dur="1.539"></text><text start="1004.224" dur="1.661">great to have a real AI system</text><text start="1004.902" dur="1.435">that could follow us</text><text start="1005.354" dur="1.539"></text><text start="1005.911" dur="1.661">and we could ask</text><text start="1006.589" dur="1.539">it questions.</text><text start="1007.146" dur="1.713">So</text><text start="1007.873" dur="1.534">we&amp;#39;re going to give it</text><text start="1008.421" dur="1.309">such a</text><text start="1008.744" dur="1.478">prompt now</text><text start="1009.236" dur="1.436">because</text><text start="1009.686" dur="1.435">we</text><text start="1010.135" dur="1.338">already have the</text><text start="1010.487" dur="1.295">Hermes</text><text start="1010.796" dur="1.436">agent.</text><text start="1011.332" dur="1.534">For example,</text><text start="1011.88" dur="1.462">if I</text><text start="1012.357" dur="1.52">come to the voice option,</text><text start="1012.891" dur="1.448">we have the</text><text start="1013.353" dur="1.39">system.</text><text start="1013.758" dur="1.561">Let</text><text start="1014.336" dur="1.587">me set it up.</text><text start="1014.939" dur="1.595">Now</text><text start="1015.547" dur="1.348">I</text><text start="1015.909" dur="1.514"></text><text start="1016.437" dur="1.5"></text><text start="1016.951" dur="1.658">have complete voice intelligence, right?  But</text><text start="1017.627" dur="1.714">I&amp;#39;m</text><text start="1018.36" dur="1.639">coming down here.  If I</text><text start="1019.012" dur="1.502"></text><text start="1019.527" dur="1.515">go to an option like Classic</text><text start="1020.056" dur="1.338">and</text><text start="1020.408" dur="1.461">turn on the gold plasma</text><text start="1020.882" dur="1.502">, I can</text><text start="1021.397" dur="1.379">chat with it</text><text start="1021.79" dur="1.447">, which is</text><text start="1022.251" dur="1.379">really</text><text start="1022.644" dur="1.534">cool.  So</text><text start="1023.199" dur="1.594"></text><text start="1023.814" dur="1.741">come down here and get started.</text><text start="1024.577" dur="1.589">Hey</text><text start="1025.195" dur="2.031">Hermes, what</text><text start="1026.254" dur="1.287">time is it today?</text><text start="1026.641" dur="1.868">Hello.</text><text start="1027.531" dur="1.849"></text><text start="1028.402" dur="1.783">Let me check it for you.</text><text start="1029.285" dur="1.991">One minute.  Well</text><text start="1030.298" dur="1.718">, it&amp;#39;s a</text><text start="1031.037" dur="1.261">voice</text><text start="1031.32" dur="1.805">interface and</text><text start="1032.146" dur="1.805">it&amp;#39;s</text><text start="1032.973" dur="1.805">connected to Hermes.</text><text start="1033.878" dur="1.763">But what I want to do is</text><text start="1034.661" dur="1.724"></text><text start="1035.405" dur="1.607"></text><text start="1036.032" dur="1.568">create a design that</text><text start="1036.619" dur="1.666">looks a lot like</text><text start="1037.305" dur="1.705">this and can</text><text start="1038.029" dur="1.686">actually be</text><text start="1038.734" dur="1.686">talked to.</text><text start="1039.52" dur="1.516">So what we&amp;#39;re going to do is</text><text start="1040.053" dur="1.677"></text><text start="1040.747" dur="1.499"></text><text start="1041.264" dur="1.622">go straight to the cloud code.</text><text start="1041.904" dur="1.588">And</text><text start="1042.51" dur="1.594">then we&amp;#39;ll</text><text start="1043.123" dur="1.408"></text><text start="1043.55" dur="1.687">get a prompt like this.</text><text start="1044.337" dur="1.615">Here, I want</text><text start="1044.97" dur="1.688">you to build</text><text start="1045.676" dur="1.688"></text><text start="1046.382" dur="1.398">an</text><text start="1046.798" dur="1.652">interactive</text><text start="1047.468" dur="1.669">voice operating</text><text start="1048.156" dur="1.615">system for me on Cloud Code OS.</text><text start="1048.789" dur="1.272"></text><text start="1049.161" dur="1.565"></text><text start="1049.743" dur="1.412"></text><text start="1050.172" dur="1.308"></text><text start="1050.497" dur="1.412"></text><text start="1050.926" dur="1.651">It should be able to answer any questions about the platform.</text><text start="1051.594" dur="1.48"></text><text start="1052.091" dur="1.654"></text><text start="1052.765" dur="1.712"></text><text start="1053.497" dur="1.752">Make it interactive and find ways to make it</text><text start="1054.269" dur="1.554">as useful as possible.</text><text start="1054.842" dur="1.554"></text><text start="1055.416" dur="1.554"></text><text start="1055.99" dur="1.776">It</text><text start="1056.787" dur="1.672"></text><text start="1057.481" dur="1.823">should contain a lot of information.</text><text start="1058.304" dur="1.838">It should be able to</text><text start="1059.163" dur="1.61">click buttons,</text><text start="1059.794" dur="1.652">move,</text><text start="1060.467" dur="1.652">and perform various</text><text start="1061.14" dur="1.799">tasks.</text><text start="1062.039" dur="1.56">I want it to be</text><text start="1062.619" dur="1.715"></text><text start="1063.353" dur="1.716"></text><text start="1064.088" dur="1.483">as</text><text start="1064.591" dur="1.657">useful to me as possible on my operating system.</text><text start="1065.267" dur="1.782">And then</text><text start="1066.067" dur="1.683">literally,</text><text start="1066.768" dur="1.395">we&amp;#39;ll send it</text><text start="1067.181" dur="1.557">to Fable.</text><text start="1067.756" dur="1.612"></text><text start="1068.468" dur="1.946">Excellent.  Now</text><text start="1069.437" dur="1.58">Fable 5 has completed it.</text><text start="1070.039" dur="1.826"></text><text start="1070.865" dur="1.661">And it seems</text><text start="1071.54" dur="1.494">we can activate it by selecting this thing above.</text><text start="1072.048" dur="1.297"></text><text start="1072.359" dur="1.48"></text><text start="1072.853" dur="1.396"></text><text start="1073.263" dur="1.69">This will turn it on</text><text start="1073.974" dur="1.821">and</text><text start="1074.817" dur="1.874">off.  And</text><text start="1075.71" dur="1.547">if I</text><text start="1076.276" dur="1.735">open it, we&amp;#39;ll</text><text start="1077.03" dur="1.803">get a voice line.  So</text><text start="1077.852" dur="1.74">let&amp;#39;s click on it.</text><text start="1078.611" dur="1.448"></text><text start="1079.078" dur="1.401"></text><text start="1079.498" dur="1.593"></text><text start="1080.11" dur="1.726">I am quite impressed with its current design.    It&amp;#39;s</text><text start="1080.936" dur="1.667"></text><text start="1081.622" dur="1.686"></text><text start="1082.326" dur="1.668">really</text><text start="1083.012" dur="1.637">cool to have something like this down on the right.  We</text><text start="1083.667" dur="1.497"></text><text start="1084.181" dur="1.621">click on the voice line and</text><text start="1084.82" dur="1.603"></text><text start="1085.441" dur="1.497">can start a conversation.</text><text start="1086.038" dur="1.886">Hello.  How are you</text><text start="1086.956" dur="1.93">doing?  Hello.</text><text start="1087.986" dur="1.802">I am very well</text><text start="1088.813" dur="1.879">, thank you.</text><text start="1089.792" dur="1.925">How are you?</text><text start="1090.817" dur="1.931">All is well.  All is</text><text start="1091.777" dur="1.91">well.  Um, please give me</text><text start="1092.703" dur="1.503"></text><text start="1093.222" dur="1.195">a</text><text start="1093.433" dur="1.438">status</text><text start="1093.888" dur="1.552">report.    Of</text><text start="1094.54" dur="2.067">course.  Here is</text><text start="1095.629" dur="1.326">your</text><text start="1095.977" dur="1.654">status.</text><text start="1096.731" dur="1.709">You have sent messages to</text><text start="1097.458" dur="1.728">over 22,000</text><text start="1098.205" dur="1.672">users so far</text><text start="1098.896" dur="1.335"></text><text start="1099.25" dur="1.691">and</text><text start="1099.959" dur="1.598">I have replied to almost 39,000.</text><text start="1100.575" dur="1.579"></text><text start="1101.173" dur="1.392"></text><text start="1101.665" dur="2.035">Excellent.  So, now</text><text start="1102.717" dur="1.31">you</text><text start="1103.045" dur="1.637">understand the concept.</text><text start="1103.699" dur="1.657">We can</text><text start="1104.373" dur="1.555">question this.</text><text start="1104.944" dur="1.705">And the</text><text start="1105.666" dur="1.41"></text><text start="1106.092" dur="1.64">idea behind this is that we can</text><text start="1106.748" dur="1.148">now</text><text start="1106.912" dur="1.739"></text><text start="1107.667" dur="1.623">create functionalities.</text><text start="1108.29" dur="1.627">So,</text><text start="1108.938" dur="1.457">from here I can ask</text><text start="1109.416" dur="1.644">questions</text><text start="1110.081" dur="1.81">, like, let&amp;#39;s say</text><text start="1110.891" dur="1.498">I&amp;#39;m</text><text start="1111.41" dur="1.707">looking at a skill.</text><text start="1112.217" dur="1.577">I want you to</text><text start="1112.812" dur="1.452"></text><text start="1113.282" dur="1.614"></text><text start="1113.914" dur="1.69">tell me more about it.  Can you</text><text start="1114.621" dur="1.37"></text><text start="1115.007" dur="1.572"></text><text start="1115.596" dur="1.571">help me improve this skill</text><text start="1116.184" dur="1.748">?  And the</text><text start="1116.95" dur="1.609">coolest</text><text start="1117.576" dur="1.555">thing is that</text><text start="1118.149" dur="1.161">it can</text><text start="1118.328" dur="1.805"></text><text start="1119.15" dur="1.501">enhance the dashboard itself</text><text start="1119.669" dur="1.68">and</text><text start="1120.367" dur="1.608">code on your desktop</text><text start="1120.993" dur="1.697">, because</text><text start="1121.708" dur="1.519">I&amp;#39;m changing it</text><text start="1122.245" dur="1.626">from blue to green</text><text start="1122.889" dur="1.662"></text><text start="1123.568" dur="1.394">and you can</text><text start="1123.98" dur="1.322"></text><text start="1124.32" dur="1.59"></text><text start="1124.928" dur="1.393">see it right on the dashboard.</text><text start="1125.339" dur="1.74">Now,</text><text start="1126.1" dur="1.778"></text><text start="1126.899" dur="1.505"></text><text start="1127.425" dur="1.442"></text><text start="1127.888" dur="1.799">using this incredible operating system is one</text><text start="1128.708" dur="1.736">thing, but</text><text start="1129.465" dur="1.61"></text><text start="1130.096" dur="1.652">with Cloud Fable 5 we</text><text start="1130.769" dur="1.589"></text><text start="1131.379" dur="1.715">need to do five things.</text><text start="1132.115" dur="1.683">They will</text><text start="1132.816" dur="1.513"></text><text start="1133.348" dur="1.513"></text><text start="1133.88" dur="1.495"></text><text start="1134.393" dur="1.697"></text><text start="1135.108" dur="1.624">take your entire business and personal life to a new level.</text><text start="1135.75" dur="1.933">And we can</text><text start="1136.709" dur="1.709"></text><text start="1137.444" dur="1.887">learn that by watching this video.</text><text start="1138.356" dur="1.381"></text></transcript>